{"5051030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BACKUP_71", "steam_appid": 5051030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BACKUP_71. The truth never dies. It waits to be found.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his father's mysterious death, <strong>Victor Gottlieb</strong> returns to his childhood home to care for his aging mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a quiet visit soon turns into a psychological nightmare. Strange fungal growth spreads throughout the house, forgotten documents reveal fragments of a hidden past, and an old computer begins communicating with someone or something that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As reality slowly unravels, Victor must investigate the house, survive the growing infestation, and uncover secrets that were never meant to resurface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/06bb8d865f343667b3e4f28f0e9baed9.poster.avif?t=1787028836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/06bb8d865f343667b3e4f28f0e9baed9.webm?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/06bb8d865f343667b3e4f28f0e9baed9.mp4?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE A HIDDEN PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every room of the house, uncover hidden compartments, examine photographs, journals, tapes, classified reports, and piece together decades of forgotten history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a fully interactive retro computer to browse files, recover corrupted documents, solve puzzles, and communicate with an unknown presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/e77a46af3195d11fcb5be7e1f4f2919f.poster.avif?t=1787028836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/e77a46af3195d11fcb5be7e1f4f2919f.webm?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/e77a46af3195d11fcb5be7e1f4f2919f.mp4?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE INFESTATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor the fungus growth, prepare treatments, craft chemical compounds, and prevent it from spreading throughout the house. Ignore it for too long, and you will regret it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RESOURCE MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited supplies while balancing exploration, investigation, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions affect the condition of the house, your own sanity, and the people still living inside.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Victor's mind deteriorates, hallucinations, impossible events, and disturbing encounters blur the line between memory and reality. Can you trust what you see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/c233357fde70cc4088fca68f770bf1a7.poster.avif?t=1787028836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/c233357fde70cc4088fca68f770bf1a7.webm?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/c233357fde70cc4088fca68f770bf1a7.mp4?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a house filled with hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully interactive retro desktop simulator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a living fungal infestation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and computer-based puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique investigation minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative inspired by Cold War conspiracies and psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambience that mixes tension with frightening vocal elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some secrets should never be recovered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BACKUP_71. The truth never dies. It waits to be found.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his father's mysterious death, <strong>Victor Gottlieb</strong> returns to his childhood home to care for his aging mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a quiet visit soon turns into a psychological nightmare. Strange fungal growth spreads throughout the house, forgotten documents reveal fragments of a hidden past, and an old computer begins communicating with someone or something that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As reality slowly unravels, Victor must investigate the house, survive the growing infestation, and uncover secrets that were never meant to resurface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/06bb8d865f343667b3e4f28f0e9baed9.poster.avif?t=1787028836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/06bb8d865f343667b3e4f28f0e9baed9.webm?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/06bb8d865f343667b3e4f28f0e9baed9.mp4?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE A HIDDEN PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every room of the house, uncover hidden compartments, examine photographs, journals, tapes, classified reports, and piece together decades of forgotten history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a fully interactive retro computer to browse files, recover corrupted documents, solve puzzles, and communicate with an unknown presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/e77a46af3195d11fcb5be7e1f4f2919f.poster.avif?t=1787028836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/e77a46af3195d11fcb5be7e1f4f2919f.webm?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/e77a46af3195d11fcb5be7e1f4f2919f.mp4?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE INFESTATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor the fungus growth, prepare treatments, craft chemical compounds, and prevent it from spreading throughout the house. Ignore it for too long, and you will regret it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RESOURCE MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited supplies while balancing exploration, investigation, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions affect the condition of the house, your own sanity, and the people still living inside.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Victor's mind deteriorates, hallucinations, impossible events, and disturbing encounters blur the line between memory and reality. Can you trust what you see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/c233357fde70cc4088fca68f770bf1a7.poster.avif?t=1787028836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/c233357fde70cc4088fca68f770bf1a7.webm?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5051030/extras/c233357fde70cc4088fca68f770bf1a7.mp4?t=1787028836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a house filled with hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully interactive retro desktop simulator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a living fungal infestation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and computer-based puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique investigation minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative inspired by Cold War conspiracies and psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambience that mixes tension with frightening vocal elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some secrets should never be recovered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragra